  "description": "New graph of y=(4/5)x-4. Intercepts (0,-4) and (5,0), with visible domain extending through x=10 and beyond enough to discuss y>4. Source306 asks point values, signs, thresholds and image of [5,10]. Add a clean numeric coordinate frame; no formula label, coordinate callouts or labels of every queried function value.",
  "source": {
    "authoredBasis": "New graph of y=(4/5)x-4. Intercepts (0,-4) and (5,0), with visible domain extending through x=10 and beyond enough to discuss y>4. Source306 asks point values, signs, thresholds and image of [5,10]. Add a clean numeric coordinate frame; no formula label, coordinate callouts or labels of every queried function value. This is newly authored mathematics, not a recovered original. Figure 77 was visually inspected only for general axes styling and is not provenance. Numeric scales, plotting windows and panel layout are deliberate authored additions. No formula is printed on the graph.",
    "authoritativeText": [
      {
        "lesson": "alg6-c2-s4-n20",
        "exercise": "306",
        "text": "作式 $y=0.8x-4$ 给出的函数的图象。利用所作图象，回答下列问题：\na) 当 $x$ 等于 $5$ 和 $1.5$ 时，函数取什么值？\nb) 当 $x$ 取什么值时，变量 $y$ 的值等于 $4$？\nc) 函数取负值、正值、大于 $4$ 的值时，$x$ 值的集合是什么？\nd) 数区间 $[5,10]$ 被映射到什么集合上？"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg6-c2-s4-n20",
        "text": "一般地，式 $y=kx+l$ 给出的函数的图象是直线。"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg6-c2-s4-n20",
        "text": "我们知道，作一条直线只要确定直线上两个点的位置就行了。"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg6-c2-s4-n20",
        "text": "如果线性函数的定义域不包括所有的数，那么它的图象是直线上点的子集（例如，射线、线段、离散点的集合）。"
      }
    ],
